Evidence-based technical research

Install:
  Install the missing bundled skill; preserve installed skill files.

Upgrade:
  Back up and replace the installed skill with bundled files; restore previous skill files if replacement fails.

Status:
  Report skill locations based on SKILL.md presence.

Requirements:
  A regular user and standard file utilities.

Configuration:
  Destination: ~/.agents/skills/research
  Existing copies at ${CODEX_HOME:-$HOME/.codex}/skills/research are consolidated into links to the destination when skill files are replaced.
